# Shell scripts run under bash, which is Git Bash on native Windows (Spec 1658),
# and bash fails on CRLF line endings. Pin LF in the working tree whatever the
# checkout's core.autocrlf, so the forge concept scripts that ship in
# packages/codev/scripts/forge/ (and every other .sh) stay runnable.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
